## 3.5ct Radiant Cut Lab Diamond Prices

Lab 3.5ct radiant stones are IGI-certified, chemically identical to natural, and completely unaffected by the natural scarcity premium that pushes natural prices past [$50,000](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28049659?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). All rings below use the [Ten Prong Solitaire 14K White Gold (item 311235)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) at [$860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

