| Stone | [D-VVS1 IGI](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28929424?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | [D-VVS1 IGI](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28472159?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | Same grade |
| Ring Total | [$6,210](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28929424?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | [$6,711](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28472159?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | +[$501](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28472159?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) |
| Face-up size | ~9.2×7.0mm | ~9.5×7.2mm | +0.3mm length |
| What this means | Strong lab value | Stronger lab value — crosses the [9.5mm Statement](#the-9-5mm-statement) | Always upgrade if budget allows |

| Comparison | 3ct Natural Ring | 3.5ct Natural Ring | Difference |
